---
import Shell from '../../../layouts/Shell.astro';
import DongriaReadingSequence from '../../../components/DongriaReadingSequence.astro';
import book from '../../../data/dongariya-book.json';
import reading from '../../../data/dongria-book-reading.json';
import guide from '../../../data/dongria-reading-guide.json';
import '../../../styles/article-reading.css';
const indexImage={src:'/assets/dongariya/00-index-clothing-1200w.webp',alt:'Illustration of two women wearing embroidered Dongria wraps against green hills.',width:1200,height:800};
---
<Shell title="Dongria Kondh: cloth, language and life in Niyamgiri" description="Twelve connected articles on Kapadaganda, Kuvi, cultivation, learning and life in Niyamgiri, with sources and credited images." active="explore" related={false} shareImage={indexImage}>
<article class="article-reading dongria-hub"><p class="eyebrow">People · Place · Living knowledge</p><h1>Dongria Kondh:<br/>life in Niyamgiri</h1><p>{guide.section_intro}</p>
<nav class="reading-actions" aria-label="Begin reading"><a href="/stories/dongria/book/#author-note">Start with the author’s story →</a><a href="#place-and-people">Begin the twelve chapters →</a><a href="/stories/dongria/book/">Read or download the book →</a></nav>
<nav class="part-shortcuts" aria-label="Parts of the Dongria collection"><ol>{guide.parts.map(part=><li><a href={'#'+part.id}>{part.title}</a></li>)}</ol></nav>
<figure class="series-hero"><img src={indexImage.src} srcset="/assets/dongariya/00-index-clothing-480w.webp 480w, /assets/dongariya/00-index-clothing-800w.webp 800w, /assets/dongariya/00-index-clothing-1200w.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width: 832px) calc(100vw - 2.8rem), 740px" alt={indexImage.alt} width={indexImage.width} height={indexImage.height} fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"/><figcaption>Dongria dress and embroidered wraps — an interpretive illustration. The figures and hillside setting are imagined.</figcaption></figure>
<DongriaReadingSequence showShortcuts={false}/>
<section class="book-card"><img src={reading.cover.at(-1)!.src} width={reading.cover.at(-1)!.width} height={reading.cover.at(-1)!.height} alt={reading.cover_alt} loading="lazy"/><div><h2>Keep the connected book</h2><p>The illustrated reading edition brings these chapters together with the author’s story, a locator, glossary and closing reflection.</p><p><a href="/stories/dongria/book/">Explore the book →</a></p><p><a href={book.file}>Download: {book.edition} · {book.pages} pages · PDF</a> ({(book.bytes / 1000000).toFixed(1)} MB).</p></div></section>
<p>By Ahimanikya Satapathy.</p><section class="series-sources"><h2>Footnotes &amp; Sources</h2><p>Chapter preview pictures retain their <a href="/stories/dongria/book/#sources">book picture credits and sources</a>. Author’s story photograph supplied by Ahimanikya Satapathy.</p><p>Book cover photograph: {reading.cover_credit.creator}. <a href={reading.cover_credit.source_url}>Source</a>. <a href={reading.cover_credit.licence_url}>{reading.cover_credit.licence}</a>. Preview of the published cover.</p><p>Adapted illustration: Project Odisha, <a href="https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/">CC BY-SA 4.0</a>. Adapted from a clothing reference: <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:The_Dongria_Khond_is_an_ancient_tribe_of_Odisha._The_Dongria_Khonds_women_performing_a_traditional_Khonda_dance.jpg">photograph by Debanutosh</a>, <a href="https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/">CC BY-SA 4.0</a>.</p></section></article></Shell>
<style>.dongria-hub{max-width:804px;padding-inline:32px}.dongria-hub :global(img){max-width:100%;height:auto}.eyebrow{color:var(--earth)}.reading-actions{display:flex;gap:1rem;flex-wrap:wrap;padding-block:1rem}.reading-actions a{padding:.5rem 0}.part-shortcuts ol{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:.5rem 1.25rem;list-style:none;padding:0;margin-block:1.5rem}.part-shortcuts li{margin:0;padding:0}.part-shortcuts a{display:inline-block;min-height:44px;padding-block:.5rem;font-size:.95rem}.series-hero img{aspect-ratio:3/2}.book-card{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) minmax(0,1.6fr);gap:2rem;align-items:center;border-block:1px solid var(--line);padding-block:2rem;margin-block:3rem}.book-card img{width:100%;height:auto;aspect-ratio:4/5}.book-card h2{margin-top:0}.series-sources{font-size:.95rem}@media(max-width:600px){.dongria-hub{padding-inline:22px}.book-card{grid-template-columns:1fr}.book-card img{max-width:260px;margin-inline:auto}}</style>
